ations><nplcit status="new"><text>NAOKI ASAMI ET AL.: 'DVD, LSI, Tamper Resistant Software, Software fukugo no kagi wo nigiru fusei copy boushi gijutsu ni medo' NIKKEI ELECTRONICS, no. 696, 18 August 1997, (TOKYO), pages 110 - 120, XP002928880</text><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit><nplcit status="new"><text>NIKKAN KOGYO SHINBUN.: 'Digital contents, copy shitemo riyou fuka' no. 18053, 24 February 1999, (TOKYO), page 13, XP002946296</text><sources><source category="Y" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1085420A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KIHARA NOBUYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SONY CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOKOTA TEPPEI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KIHARA, NOBUYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SONY CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOKOTA, TEPPEI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KIHARA NOBUYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOKOTA TEPPEI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KIHARA, NOBUYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOKOTA, TEPPEI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>The invention is characterized in that when data is processed by moving/copying the contents from a server having a large-capacity memory to a memory card, and vice versa, the information about the history of data moving/copying is stored in a nonvolatile memory, and the data moving/copying from the server to the memory card is inhibited or allowed according to the history information. The invention is further characterized in that when encrypted contents are sent to a server device having a large-capacity memory from a terminal, the key for decryption is re-encrypted and sent, and the re-encrypted key is further encrypted differently by the server device, thus performing two-stage encryption and thereby enhancing the security of copyright protection.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention se caractérise en ce que, lors du traitement de données par déplacement/copie du contenu d'un serveur ayant une mémoire de grande capacité dans une carte mémoire, et vice versa, les informations relatives à l'historique de l'opération de déplacement/copie des données sont stockées dans une mémoire non volatile, et l'opération de déplacement/copie des données du serveur à la carte mémoire est interdite ou autorisée en fonction de ces informations historiques. Cette invention se caractérise en outre en ce que, lors de l'envoi d'un contenu crypté à un dispositif serveur ayant une mémoire de grande capacité à partir d'un terminal, la clé de décryptage est cryptée à nouveau et envoyée, et la clé ainsi cryptée à nouveau est ensuite cryptée différemment par le dispositif serveur, ce qui équivaut à un cryptage en deux étapes, améliorant ainsi la sécurité de protection du droit d'auteur.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>